    "reason": "[ev-e547b535705c] shows the only changed file is manifests/ha/base/redis-ha/chart/values.yaml, which is used to generate Argo CD's HA manifests. [ev-6fa01ca35988] says the null securityContext caused an unwanted diff in upstream.yaml that failed CI, so this is a build fix, not a removed customer-facing Helm value. No excerpt names the key path redis-ha.securityContext ([ev-c5612ed57e07] only says 'null security context'). Removing a null entry takes away nothing an operator could have set, so 'removed' on that subject is not supported.",
